{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"8421af068e627f36","x":-70,"y":-462,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":""},
		{"id":"c7ec64eb7d42a87c","x":-160,"y":-241,"width":889,"height":666,"type":"text","text":"Se dispara una alarma (Para legacy un evento - alarm true, para 1280 alarm-12830).\nEl cliente puede hacer un `ACK` manual de alarma recibida pulsando un botón en el cliente y enviando la petición a `/api/alarm/:id/ack`\n\n `/api/alarm/:id/ack` \n\n\nFlujo actual \nBusca el evento, busca su ack \n\n```js\n//Legacy\ncopyData.event.ack = {\n\tackAt: new Date(),\n\tackAtGMT: DateHelper.parseUTCOffset(new Date(), device.getUTCOffset()),\n\tackBy: parseExternalUserEmail(this.context.user.username),\n\tcomment: comment\n}\n//Se envia a\nSendAmqp.sendEventRPC(\"event.ack\", copyData, 50000)\n```"},
		{"id":"432326df9789914e","type":"text","text":"***`Device`***\n\nDispara una alarma","x":-1185,"y":-280,"width":160,"height":100},
		{"id":"b0debc368f8fc10b","type":"text","text":">[!success] ***`Persistencia de datos`***\n\n>***Colecciones involucradas***\n\n***`Legacy - events {isAlarm:True}`***\n***`nuevos - alarm12830`***","x":-1260,"y":-120,"width":310,"height":182,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"077f424588c4bfb8","x":-950,"y":-300,"width":280,"height":140,"type":"text","text":"***`client`***\n Hace un `ACK` manual de alarma recibida pulsando un botón en el cliente y enviando la petición a la API"},
		{"id":"4dae9c370922ddec","type":"text","text":"***`API`***\n***`/api/alarm/:id/ack` ***\n","x":-580,"y":-280,"width":200,"height":100},
		{"id":"7177e595c0486263","type":"text","text":"***`API`***\n- Busca en `events` por su `_id`\n\t- De no ser una alarma sale\n- Busca en `eventacks` por el _id del  evento.\n\t- si existe es que ya se izo ese `ACK` y sale\n- Se crean datos para enviar al `rabbit` en ***`sendEventRPC(\"event.ack\", copyData, 50000)`***","x":-720,"y":-48,"width":420,"height":268}
	],
